      (vsf-api d09bf6c7, vsf-sandbox d6a44230) still owe a
      generative-source sync from ~/vsf/docs/governance/covenant.vsm.",
  what: "Found 2026-08-02 while restoring this repo's LICENSE (had drifted
      to a plain AGPL-3.0 draft from 2026-04-12, never touched again,
      while the real canonical license -- VSF Kernel License 1.0,
      FSL-1.1-based, issued 2026-05-01 -- went live on vsf.u2738.org/license
